<fragment mode="section" requested-start="doxcnGmFBl2QjkqMjVyZ40SpiSb"><h2 id="doxcnGmFBl2QjkqMjVyZ40SpiSb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.1">首页与导航</h2><p id="doxcnE149dumxRhfZkZvZ9t1Ohb">对应 PRD 3.1.1、3.2.4。</p><h3 id="doxcnOQqf7Wl0VdPwc7JnaeFtLf" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.1.1">前端页面</h3><grid id="doxcnT84MHIg962tcKUgtPDSHYd"><column id="doxcnJGgOxaab74dYkPANwE3zeh" width-ratio="0.500000"><p id="doxcnBZp3wiMTCUBwSGbamIEIff"><b>页面组成：</b>首页包含 Banner、主要功能入口和底部 Tab。</p><p id="doxcn0CLd01DYOsjPADlFrMqbff"><b>页面入口：</b>用户可以进入手串 DIY、标准商品商城、购物车和个人中心；未上线的功能入口显示“即将上线”。</p></column><column id="doxcnNaCFww9UITxRViHZfGOaWe" width-ratio="0.500000"><img id="doxcnH28VWCmWSdIAlENopCGhHc" name="test.jpg" caption="PRD：首页与底部导航&#xA;" mime="image/jpeg" scale="0.388888" src="ERatbvZStotVkLxFRN6cDm78nKb"/></column></grid><h3 id="doxcnwEiNHlAwLjlqHyI2uNc3mw" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.1.2">配置读取流程</h3><whiteboard id="doxcnH3m1kE6Lq26Ta8b1UBCbPc" token="Hfe3wArWOhJm2Jbd1fAcam4Mntf" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户小程序
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    U-&gt;&gt;B: 打开首页，读取公开配置
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 查询 site_config 有效公开键
    D--&gt;&gt;B: config_value
    B--&gt;&gt;U: Banner、客服、入口状态
    U-&gt;&gt;U: 点击入口，已上线跳转或提示即将上线</whiteboard><h3 id="doxcnBoD4eckSgXeqh6yanuuhfb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.1.3">后端接口设计</h3><h4 id="doxcn3KwN1xQbeUjHWZSotv5Rjd" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.1.3.1">接口清单</h4><table id="doxcneqDa6fcjdwAKeDcouekr1d"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOyqKe1HwaYjRUwSjpVKmM2">云函数与 action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnoQSrNwoQWvfzqwhU07lYLe">调用方与身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcno3WGEq6tqJcKDQRtAVp0Ke">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRWS2pI9fOJKvizgzTSFaxb">business-api<br/>getPublicSiteConfig</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnWVD1sbZcUCZGlGOURC5OOd">用户小程序；不按用户身份过滤</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnzIcYpcdId4QbsEwBlXcndb">一次返回首页 Banner、公开客服信息和功能入口状态。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcn7H4PgQE2eccRMByowXYabf"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcnhxfpC6gkElfBTW2YEYUoTh"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvIgAaytmqA0pNOJqvOGRog">action / 路由</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn9oJDDkPA7FV6f1ZdGqgTNg">Handler / Controller</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnprIxy6XGYu2VE1cDclctqV">Service</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4xp9yUx8bC47lTjniXMcVh">UnitOfWork</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn7vb4D1KQDrUEb0v2iyssJe">DAO / Client</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqZNbYgsCIp3QO2XJLoYG9d">getPublicSiteConfig</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQh0EnwBXXUvWU3oMvZXtYb">GetPublicSiteConfigHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnXgTD9Jp37mgdxpH3j7h8mb">SiteConfigService</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn120YigdjU6ED0KARty3GKh">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcna7JqmRXkHFHGommfmdiIkc">SiteConfigDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnjB6q9clftQYrDkjqAyZ1VK" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.1.3.2">getPublicSiteConfig</h4><p id="doxcngNABHuLwyhnJn0zm9exFrx" text-indent="1">首页只读取后端固定允许公开的三类配置。客户端不能自行传入 config_key，从接口层避免读取到支付、管理员或其他内部配置。</p><p id="doxcnfAQp4iQQNZ5z30Zm8FUpPg"><b>请求 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcn6l4Hq3eq5DfPKedKRMVrOg" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getPublicSiteConfig",<br/>  "payload": {}<br/>}</code></pre><table id="doxcnvjfYACDdRbqNL3miEDbZLg"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnl0vSmGmBJOlKWkNT8acNUe">字段</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrzcHEj2babCv1Ne7y0PF2g">类型</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfHoytEgzUju4n7aIZGW3lc">必填</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjgRHMYU5UlieOnNUgtMvdg">含义</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnnbjKdNjVaAUdC2Bjhy8Sbh">action</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnXCZOaGlNeNT5pHd32lu2bh">string</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnaXAHONqJ68AZx8cEdbxnpd">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnDEXAHrm46DKbnB81pBNCRh">固定为 getPublicSiteConfig。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjkkXKAWzBEEH6EcRky0QcJ">payload</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3stBmxUi1ifn9uvfpfTepc">object</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbsRUaAhb5ty26KUElZShy6">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnUdwYjyJtc4Piua30uKfMrh">固定为空对象；不接受 config_key。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcn47o6TfqpbH30eGo6FBcBVd"><b>响应 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnY5O0iDyyt2h9dZfpP7rv3b" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "ok",<br/>  "request_id": "平台请求标识",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "banners": [<br/>      {<br/>        "image_file_id": "cloud://home/banner-1.png",<br/>        "link_type": "PAGE",<br/>        "link_value": "/pages/design/index",<br/>        "sort_order": 10<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "customer_service": {<br/>      "wechat_id": "公开客服微信号",<br/>      "qr_file_id": "cloud://service/qr.png"<br/>    },<br/>    "feature_entries": [<br/>      {"key": "DIY", "enabled": true}<br/>    ]<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><table id="doxcnZt4yKv2HWCVAndoCy5bbyf"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn43jzhavrj4IQoBidA4nF7e">data 字段</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngW0eNOdh3ZwYli0jgVFqlf">含义</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngQlkceoc0sOVUhYgpchHUf">banners</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNpcTZaiBMRbkuehsqZOaGg">按 sort_order 排序的首页 Banner；图片字段保存云存储文件标识。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1klivfCB3Pkpvkt4LZChE5">customer_service</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcneQsve3UUXMJHEVgLaPFExh">允许用户查看的客服微信号和二维码文件标识；未配置时返回 null。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnIMIgj9QVODbA2AA8JrNq9d">feature_entries</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFJMsTNUZ3J6czan76pvgfe">首页功能入口开关；enabled=false 时前端显示“即将上线”。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcn0F93vDix8l4qq9BAM7GKBg"><b>后端处理步骤</b></p><ol><li id="doxcnyzKcTOsYdl8pYL6KcgVYbf" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">GetPublicSiteConfigHandler 校验 action，忽略客户端身份字段，不读取客户端传入的配置键。</li><li id="doxcnqJqoww3J26cR2dbTIlCvhg" seq-marker="2. ">SiteConfigDAO 查询 config_key IN ('home_banners','customer_service','feature_entries') AND is_deleted=0。</li><li id="doxcnnay5XqiXanLf6f13H6oHab" seq-marker="3. ">SiteConfigService 按三个配置键分别校验 config_value JSON 结构，并过滤未定义字段。</li><li id="doxcnzf1v0Tng2Px2InjvNd8kvg" seq-marker="4. ">home_banners 按配置中的 sort_order 排序；缺失配置使用空数组或 null，不把整页视为失败。</li><li id="doxcnN3jJH8BX4pcslG8ynuSTia" seq-marker="5. ">返回云存储文件标识和公开字段；商户凭证、支付配置、管理员 UID 等内容不进入响应。</li></ol><p id="doxcnma3guUMFTcGZXH3egxlmQc"><b>数据库读取</b></p><table id="doxcnv3qtn0C5hxSOpVMBjr7Dch"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn0acepUwcdBLt3K09dQPPdd">数据表</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4009XFl3HM6xqxCm2wlpQd">查询条件</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZGq06x2EEc8uNS6Mkbgtwf">事务</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnikXnN5lggaeZdv1fxfJ39d">site_config</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcneInWFJKkJtTU9guOXnDIBe">config_key 在三个公开键中，且 is_deleted=0。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnxHxsm7bOCDGrf36QI6DWge">只读，不开启事务。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcn9zFOomO6SoqRqDiyo1eCs3"><b>错误处理</b></p><table id="doxcnVQleJJdeewXW26kdJthwOb"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnhttkeFWHNz06hYRQKAn2ge">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRJCGT9nVwzYmAmfModhU7g">触发条件</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnuEErmIUUH81SVVQr2Ila5d">前端处理</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHFsG4Pm8pW0ij5mDOO1dab">CONFIG_INVALID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyDAmYk2rOmSthHzj8E9awh">数据库中的公开配置 JSON 不符合约定结构。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngtZVelWbgA2vV3CBEjfVgc">记录 request_id，显示安全默认页面，不展示原始配置内容。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></fragment>
